min-width:fit-content;"&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;% of both our total company remaining performance obligation revenue and commercial remaining performance obligation revenue over the next &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt; months and the remainder thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock>
