        <link:footnote id="FNT_a8710291-bd38-483d-94d5-36b78a99fad1" xlink:label="FNT_a8710291-bd38-483d-94d5-36b78a99fad1" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US"><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Includes billings to OEMs and certain multinational organizations because of the nature of these businesses and the impracticability of determining the geographic source of the revenue.</xhtml:span></link:footnote>
